<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>enter the topic</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="../stylesheets/main.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="../stylesheets/navicon.css">

</head>
<body>
<div id="dashboard-fab">
  <a href="/dashboard" class="fab-btn">
<img 
  src="<%= user.profile_pic ? '/uploads/' + user.profile_pic : '/images/default-user.png' %>" alt="User"> 
  </a>
</div>
      <div class="section2">
    <div class="sub1">
      <div class="headings" id="feature">Features..</div>
<div class="cards-container">
<div class="card color1 color-black">
  <img class="logo" src="../images/neural.png" alt="3D Roadmap">
</div>

<div class="card color2">
  <h3>Smart Topic Insights</h3>
  <p>Click any node to unlock detailed explanations, prerequisites, and real-world examples for deeper understanding.</p>
</div>

<div class="card color3">
  <h3>YouTube Learning Hub</h3>
  <p>Watch curated YouTube tutorials for every AI topic — learn directly from top creators and educators.</p>
</div>

<div class="card color4">
  <h3>Personalized PDF Roadmap</h3>
  <p>Generate your full AI learning roadmap as a downloadable PDF — customized for your selected skills and goals.</p>
</div>

<div class="card color5 color-black" >
  <h3>AI Learning Visualization</h3>
  <p>Explore AI through interactive graphs and video lessons. Grasp complex ideas faster using visual explanations.</p>
</div>

<div class="card color6">
  <h3>3D Interactive Roadmap</h3>
  <p>Visualize your entire AI learning journey in a stunning 3D view. Explore topics, connections, and goals interactively.</p>
</div>

</div>
</div>
  </div>
  <div class="headings">Inputs..</div>
  <div class="sub2">
  
  <div class="side">
    <img src="../images/neural.png" alt="logo">
    <p>Begin with a single filament of thought
Share your topic, and watch it weave into a full learning journey.</p>
    <h1>MAP</h1>
  </div>

  <div class="main-content">
    <h2>Enter Your Topic</h2>
    <div class="form-box">
<form action="/generate-roadmap" method="POST">
  <div class="greay-box">
    <div class="white-box">
      <img src="../images/Cat 🍘.jpeg" alt="logo">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="width:100%;">
    <label for="topic">Enter the topic</label>
    <input type="text" id="topic" name="prompt" placeholder="EX.. Game Programming" required>
  </div>

  <div style="width:100%;">
  <label for="level">Select Level</label>
<select name="level" id="level" required>
  <option value="basic">Basic (5–10 topics)</option>
  <option value="intermediate">Intermediate (10–15 topics)</option>
  <option value="advanced">Advanced (25–30 topics)</option>
</select>

  </div>

  <button type="submit" class="submit-btn">
    <span>→</span> Submit
  </button>
</form>

    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="background-num">00</div>

</div>
<div class="headings">Things To Know..</div>
<div class="last2">
  <div class="roadmap-section">

    <div class="roadmap-step">
      <div class="step-number">01</div>
      <div class="step-title">Avoid Short Forms</div>
      <ul class="step-list">
      <li>
  Use Full Topic Names<br>
  Avoid abbreviations<br>
  Enter clear keywords<br>
  Ensures accurate results
</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="roadmap-step">
      <div class="step-number">02</div>
      <div class="step-title">Takes Time</div>
      <ul class="step-list">
       <li>
  Roadmap Takes Some Time<br>
  Processing your input<br>
  Generating structured steps<br>
  Please wait patiently
</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="roadmap-step">
      <div class="step-number">03</div>
      <div class="step-title">Not All Have One</div>
      <ul class="step-list">
       <li>
  YouTube Videos Not Guaranteed<br>
  Some topics are rare<br>
  Not always documented<br>
  Alternatives will be suggested
</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
<div class="about">
  
  <div class="gallery-image gallery-left">
    <img src="../images/artright.jpg" alt="">
  </div>

  <div class="gallery-image gallery-center">
    <img src="../images/The Starry Night.jpg" alt="">
  </div>

  <div class="gallery-image gallery-right">
    <img src="../images/artleft.jpg" alt="">
  </div>

  <div class="folder-wrapper">
    <div class="folder-tab"></div>
    <a href="/about" class="folder-body" target="_blank"></a>
  </div>
</div>
<script src="https://unpkg.com/gsap@3/dist/gsap.min.js"></script>

</body>
</html>